			"Message": "chore(Element): Regenerate build artifacts and RouteManifest after hierarchy update\n\nTrigger a full recompilation of the TypeScript source and ESBuild bundling pipeline within the Cocoon component to synchronize the `Target/` directory with the recently updated strict PascalCase source hierarchy.\n\nThe `RouteManifest.ts` is regenerated with a fresh timestamp to reflect the current build cycle, ensuring all compiled JavaScript bundles and source maps accurately represent the latest code state. This maintenance step guarantees consistency across the extension host dependency graph, including gRPC clients, VSCodeAPI handlers, and Mountain integration layers, preventing runtime discrepancies between the source tree and the bundled artifact consumed by the editor.",
			"SHA": "dadfd1af82c86679fecfab5c179dc4a009fc73e1"
		},
